### VENDOR - generate today's pickup slots
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "open_time": "10:00",
  "close_time": "14:00",
  "interval_minutes": 15,
  "capacity": 10
}

### VENDOR - list my slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### VENDOR - change a slot's capacity (change the id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "capacity": 20
}

### VENDOR - remove a slot (change the id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### Login as the stall owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.vendor@carsu.edu.ph",
  "password": "password123"
}

### VENDOR - generate slots
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "open_time": "22:15",
  "close_time": "23:45",
  "interval_minutes": 15,
  "capacity": 10
}